    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d155-a1">

                <pb facs="0572" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1951v01/pg556"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">annex</hi><anchor n="‡" xml:id="d155-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>Summary records of the meetings of the Committee of Twelve (A/AC.50/SR.1 to /SR.9
                    inclusive). (Document A/AC.50/1 is appended to document A/AC.50/SR.4.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d155-f1" n="‡" type="source" xml:id="d155-f1-content">
                <p>General distribution has already been made of the documents mentioned in
                    paragraph 8—”Historical survey of the activities of the League of Nations
                    regarding the question of disarmament, 1920–1937”; “(1) The organization and
                    scheme of work of the League of Nations in the matter of disarmament; (2)
                    Treatment of the question of chemical and bacteriological warfare in the League
                    of Nations; (3) The exchange of information on armaments under the League of
                    Nations”. [Footnote in the source text. The annex, consisting of the summary
                    records, is not printed here.]</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
